{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19247","headline":"荅东阳于令寒碧图诗 · 刘禹锡","name":"荅东阳于令寒碧图诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东阳本是佳山水，何况曾经沈隐侯。\n化得邦人解吟咏，如今县令亦风流。\n新开谭洞疑仙境，远写丹青到雍州。\n落在寻常画师手，犹能三伏凛生秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19247.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19247","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}